<title>USA: Darden Restaurants Q1 summary.</title>
<headline>Darden Restaurants Q1 summary.</headline>
<dateline>ORLANDO, Fla. 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr	profit	  $0.13     loss	 $0.08</p>
<p> Net	profit	   20.5     loss	  12.1</p>
<p> Sales			805.6		    836.0</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   157.7		    158.3</p>
<p>(In millions, except per share data)</p>
<p>NOTE: In last year's first quarter, company recorded a $75 million pre-tax restructuring charge to discontinue China Coast. This was a $44.8 million after-tax charge equivalent to $o.28 per share. After this unusual item, last year's first quarter showed a net loss of $12.1 million or $0.08 per share.</p>
